><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Bence</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Hanbury</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Kulej</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><source>Formative evaluation of accredited programmes</source><year>2006</year><publisher-name>York, The Higher Education Academy</publisher-name><comment>Ref Type: Report</comment></citation></ref><ref id="B27"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kontoghiorghes</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Factors Affecting Training Effectiveness in the Context of the Introduction of New Technology &#x02013; A US Case Study</article-title><source>International Journal of Training and Development</source><year>2004</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>248</fpage><lpage>260</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/1468-2419.00137</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B28"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bassett</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name></person-group><source>Summary report &#x02013; Cross-Border Higher Education for Capacity Development</source><year>2006</year><publisher-name>World Bank, OECD, Nuffic Seminar. The Hague</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B29"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Anderson</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Krathwohl</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><source>A Taxonomy for Learning, Teaching and Assessing: A Revision of Bloom's Taxonomy of Educational Objectives</source><year>2001</year><publisher-name>New York: Longman</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B30"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lister</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Wilder</surname><given-na